# Tests for model.sem: every invariant of `buildModel` is verified below, on a
# small module and on sources it refuses.

modelTest is test
modelTest purpose "A module's entities are found by name, with their kinds and the rows they own"
modelTest verifies buildModel groupsEntities
modelTest verifies buildModel namesEntities
modelTest typeParameter none
modelTest input none
modelTest output none
modelTest outputOwnedBy none
modelTest raises none
modelTest effect none
modelTest uses none
modelTest memoryHeap true
modelTest async false
modelTest maxRecursion none
modelTest label begin loopKind none
modelTest label begin within none
modelTest label lexed loopKind none
modelTest label lexed within none
modelTest label grouped loopKind none
modelTest label grouped within none
modelTest label modelled loopKind none
modelTest label modelled within none
modelTest label founddemo loopKind none
modelTest label founddemo within none
modelTest label foundstdoutWriter loopKind none
modelTest label foundstdoutWriter within none
modelTest label foundmain loopKind none
modelTest label foundmain within none
modelTest label foundgreet loopKind none
modelTest label foundgreet within none
modelTest label refused loopKind none
modelTest label refused within none
modelTest let source String "# a comment line\ndemo is module\ndemo purpose \"A module to model\"\ndemo path demo\n\nstdoutWriter is capability\nstdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none\n\nmain is operation\nmain input none\n\ngreet is call\ngreet in main\n" immutable
modelTest let demoName String "demo" immutable
modelTest let demoKind Int64 1 immutable
modelTest let demoFirst Int64 0 immutable
modelTest let demoCount Int64 3 immutable
modelTest let stdoutWriterName String "stdoutWriter" immutable
modelTest let stdoutWriterKind Int64 2 immutable
modelTest let stdoutWriterFirst Int64 3 immutable
modelTest let stdoutWriterCount Int64 2 immutable
modelTest let mainName String "main" immutable
modelTest let mainKind Int64 4 immutable
modelTest let mainFirst Int64 5 immutable
modelTest let mainCount Int64 2 immutable
modelTest let greetName String "greet" immutable
modelTest let greetKind Int64 5 immutable
modelTest let greetFirst Int64 7 immutable
modelTest let greetCount Int64 2 immutable
modelTest let four Int64 4 immutable
modelTest let refusedText String "the front end refused the source or a step failed" immutable
modelTest at begin do lex
modelTest at begin branch ifError lex goto refused else goto lexed
modelTest at lexed do newWords
modelTest at lexed do newRows
modelTest at lexed do group
modelTest at lexed branch ifError group goto refused else goto grouped
modelTest at grouped do newEntities
modelTest at grouped do newNames
modelTest at grouped do model
